1
00:00:00,980 --> 00:00:03,400
(Howard:)Because you can die that way.

2
00:00:04,734 --> 00:00:06,444
(Raj:)Oh, that would be a good way to go.

3
00:00:08,946 --> 00:00:11,076
(Penny:)-Hi.
-Oh, hey.

4
00:00:11,282 --> 00:00:14,032
(Sheldon:)Good, Penny.
Reminder, bowling tonight at 7:00.

5
00:00:14,243 --> 00:00:16,123
(Penny:)Oh, right. Bowling.

6
00:00:16,329 --> 00:00:18,289
(Leonard:)You don't have to come
if you don't want.

7
00:00:18,498 --> 00:00:22,378
(Penny:)No, no, it's okay. I mean, let's face it,
you would get creamed without me.

8
00:00:22,585 --> 00:00:24,795
(Sheldon:)We would indeed.
In this particular case...

9
00:00:24,962 --> 00:00:27,882
(Sheldon:)...your lack of femininity
works to our advantage.

10
00:00:29,509 --> 00:00:32,719
Yeah. It's always nice chatting with you,
Sheldon.

11
00:00:33,805 --> 00:00:37,515
(Sheldon:)-Sarcasm?
PENNY: Thinly veiled contempt.

12
00:00:38,351 --> 00:00:40,641
-Remember, 7:00.
PENNY: Got it.

13
00:00:40,812 --> 00:00:43,232
(Sheldon:)-Pacific Daylight Time.
PENNY: Bite me.

14
00:00:44,482 --> 00:00:46,822
(Sheldon:)Please reserve that butch spirit
for the lanes.

15
00:00:54,492 --> 00:00:57,162
(Howard:)I thought you were bringing
your own bowling shoes.

16
00:00:57,328 --> 00:01:00,018
(Sheldon:)These are my own bowling shoes.

